message: "このソフトウェアを研究で使った場合は、次の情報で引用してください。If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below. Please also cite the original data sources listed in DATA_LICENSES.md."
title: "Pathways Viewer for Saccharomyces cerevisiae"
abstract: "A viewer for regulatory relations between budding yeast genes (signaling and transcription), with literature-checked evidence, condition filters, measured deletion-strain data, and path search between genes."
